# Build-context ignore for the build/ all-in-one image (context = repo root).
# Required at the context root because podman / podman-compose do NOT honor the
# per-Dockerfile build/Dockerfile.dockerignore (that's BuildKit-only). Without
# this, the multi-GB .venv dirs get copied into the build context and the podman
# machine runs out of disk ("input/output error", "server probably quit").
**/.venv
.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.git
**/dist
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
cuga-skills-ui
docs
